Cut 2026-10-21 on Anthony's word ("Merge 783. Then cut the reflow2 release, move it to flo2.io, then hxm_program"; the tag push stays his), in PR release/v0.90.0. A minor carrying:
- #778 (P5): a claim resting on a hypothesis test reads supported at alpha, never shown; the criteria lock; alpha spent as a budget (Bonferroni, Holm, BH);
- #779 (P6 PR1): the design-an-argument skill; objections aimed at a step; every line's assumptions;
- #780 (P6 PR2): contested instead of unproven; disputes read both ways; concessions; a write says what it refutes; statement kinds objection/reply/unstated_premise/method_rule; rule immediate; rests-on; an argument held in its project;
- #781 (P6 PR3): what-ifs and what goes stale; a moved test reads unknown until acknowledged; a what-if on a premise reaches only what rests on it;
- #782 (P6 PR4): evidence and judgement with source_reliability, information_credibility, reported_at, confidence; natural deduction (rule_node, establishes, conclusion_form, PREMISE.uses, holds_as); now_refuted from the bulk edge writers;
- #783 (P6 PR5): small faults 1-15 (setpoint, Constraint.source, silent_on, also_records, withdraw_question by question id, a walk from a check stops before GOVERNED_BY, loop_status.session counted); same_formula_as; undocumented evidence reads conditional; the hub name-prefix fault.

200 tools, as in 0.89.0; measured against the published 0.89.0 binary, nine tools' input schemas differ (new arguments and enum values) and withdraw_question's description; 34 skills (design-an-argument new; design-a-proof, brainstorm and detect-and-ask bodies changed); get_instructions byte-identical. THE SCHEMA STAMP MOVES (enum_values: six statement_kind values, Inference.rule immediate, Constraint.direction setpoint, new enum properties), so docs/upgrading-to-v0.90.0.md is owed and written, measured with the published 0.89.0 binary: every seat upgrades together. Nothing is deprecated or removed. Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019Xbw6PG9mXJiU2Sb421fnq
